import ../../helpers/driver.dl
import ../../../ui/source_tools.dl
import ../../../ui/source_panes.dl

appearance code appearance:
    padding is 12
    height is 160
    background is UI ink 245 247 249
    corner radius is 8
    border width is 1
    border is UI ink 190 200 210

document editors:
    source pane "Studio" containing "abc" using code appearance
    source pane "River" containing "row" using code appearance

set instance to an instance of editors
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 600 by 600 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
enable UI source tools for workspace in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set studio to the UI source editor labeled "Studio" in workspace
set river to the UI source editor labeled "River" in workspace
set theme to [@intrinsic("construct", UI source token style, "keyword", UI ink 110 175 225)]
require condition ((studio's back != river's back) and (studio's home != river's home)) reporting "Reusable source panes shared private button identity."
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition (((the UI element (studio's back) is enabled in window) = false) and ((the UI element (river's home) is enabled in window) = false)) reporting "An empty source navigation history offered Back or Main file."
set main to studio's document
set imported to a UI source document named "helper.dl" at "file:///lib/helper.dl" containing "a helper" in (main's project)
visit UI source document imported selecting 0 through 1 in studio in (the address of view)
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition ((the UI element (studio's back) is enabled in window) and (the UI element (studio's home) is enabled in window)) reporting "Opening an imported source did not enable its navigation actions."
require condition ((the UI value for (studio's location) in window)'s text = "helper.dl · Read only") reporting "The source pane did not identify its imported read-only file."
require condition ((the UI value for (river's location) in window)'s text = "main.dl") reporting "Updating one source pane changed another pane's location."
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set {focused editor} to the UI layout for element (studio's node) in (view's layout)
require condition ((view's focused = focused editor) and (view's text focus = studio's node)) reporting "Enabling the pane's navigation buttons moved keyboard focus out of its source editor."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 4 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (studio's document = main) reporting "An imported source lost its Back shortcut after painting enabled navigation buttons."
visit UI source document imported selecting 0 through 1 in studio in (the address of view)
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
activate (studio's home) belonging to (studio's home) in window
require condition (UI source palette (workspace's palette) matches theme) reporting "A source navigation action replaced the application's token theme."
require condition ((studio's document = main) and (river's document = river's document's project's entry)) reporting "Main file navigation used another pane's context."
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
activate (studio's back) belonging to (studio's back) in window
require condition (studio's document = imported) reporting "The source pane's Back button did not restore the imported view."
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set {editor layout} to the UI layout for element (studio's node) in (view's layout)
set {back layout} to the UI layout for element (studio's back) in (view's layout)
set {pane layout} to the UI layout for element (studio's pane) in (view's layout)
require condition (editor layout's bounds' height = 160.0) reporting "The source pane changed the declared editor height."
require condition (pane layout's bounds' height > editor layout's bounds' height) reporting "The source pane header overlaid its source text."
require condition (editor layout's painted bounds' y >= (back layout's painted bounds' y + back layout's bounds' height)) reporting "The source pane's navigation controls covered its first source line."
free UI source workspace workspace
require condition (window's handlers = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI handler)) reporting "Closing source panes retained callbacks to their freed workspace."
close the address of view
close window
print line "Declarative source panes share scoped navigation buttons without overlapping source content."
